  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "start-here",
      "x": 870,
      "y": 1660,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "Start here.\n\nThe Session is the hero and the only screen where the sync engine is visible — the playhead crosses every listener, and each dot sits at their real drift. Out of sync is something you see, not something you read.\n\nFlip role and sync above the frame."
    },
    {
      "id": "wired",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 760,
      "w": 400,
      "text": "These are wired, not flat. Tabs switch, sheets open, toggles toggle. Where a screen has meaningfully different states — linked-free vs premium, empty vs full, host vs passenger — they are switchable from the chips above each frame."
    },
    {
      "id": "one-colour",
      "x": 2175,
      "y": 902,
      "w": 340,
      "text": "The aqua #57E2D5 appears only where something is live, playing, joinable or in sync.\n\nIf you see it anywhere passive — a selected form row, a decorative icon, a success tick — that is a bug, and worth telling me about."
    }
  ],
  "launch": { "view": "canvas", "page": "screens" }
